S001200.text:
Throughout my time in Congress, I’ve fought to protect hardworking Americans’ freedom to choose how they classify their work. That’s why I introduced and helped to pass the Modern Worker Empowerment Act and the Modern Worker Security Act through the House >@EdWorkforceCmte.  
Clarifying the definition of “independent contractor” empowers millions with the flexibility to set their own schedules and better balance work and family life.

@USDOL’s new rule restores that freedom and is a major win for the American worker!
